# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites text files to CRLF, which makes
# `prettier --check` fail locally while passing in CI, and makes the release
# zip differ byte for byte between a Windows and a Linux build.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
